      "source": "<a href=\"SimpleResourceDescription.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>SimpleResourceDescription</code></a> that additionally captures a type to be able to potentially create a reasonable\ndefault message. The implementation will do so for enum types by rendering the available values as default message\nand also provide them as arguments for message resolution.",
